+### Deploy the demo on Wasmer
+
+[![Deploy to Wasmer](https://img.shields.io/badge/Deploy%20to-Wasmer-171717?logo=wasmer&logoColor=white)](https://wasmer.io/apps/create?github=ColorlibHQ%2FAdminLTE)
+
+Wasmer serves the committed `dist/` folder (the same files the Netlify demo publishes) as a static site: the `Staticfile` in the repository root points it at `dist`, and no build step runs. The button deploys this repository as-is and does not fork it; to deploy your own changes, fork the repository, rebuild `dist/` with `npm run build`, then import your fork on Wasmer. This publishes the demo pages, so follow [Security & production deployment](#security--production-deployment) for real applications.
+
 ## What's new in v4
 
 The v4 line is a ground-up rewrite on Bootstrap 5.3 with **no jQuery**: 18 new demo pages
